            "speaker_id": 478747,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks! I'm on it. Skimming through it now, looks like a good start. I'll cross-reference this with the initial site notes I've been compiling for the feasibility study (T5). We need to make sure the physical footprint requirements are realistic.",
