            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 9197,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Got it. I'll focus on Section 4, 'Interfaces'. We need to be very specific about the data exchange protocol with the existing BMS. The current draft says 'standard industrial protocol' - can we define whether that's Modbus TCP, DNP3, or something else? It impacts the electrical integration design.",
