            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 523835,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks. My main concern is testability. For each requirement in A1, we should define a clear acceptance criterion. How will we verify 'high accuracy state-of-charge estimation' during commissioning, for example? We need measurable targets.",
