            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "Thanks @9197. I'm looking at the layout. Option B, placing the monitoring cabinet next to Panel P-45, seems best for cable runs. Option A is too far and would require longer conduits. Can we confirm there's enough clearance for door swing and maintenance access with Option B?",
