            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 478747,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "I checked my site photos from the T5 survey. There's about 1.5 meters of clearance next to P-45, which should be plenty. I agree, Option B is the most practical. I'll update the feasibility sheet A3 to formally recommend it.",
