            "speaker_id": 523835,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, with the electrical design frozen, I've drafted the Commissioning and Acceptance Test Checklist (A4) and a proposed schedule for the installation weekend. This is the main deliverable for T6. Please review and provide your feedback.",
