            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Thanks @523835. I've reviewed the electrical checks section. It's thorough. You've included continuity, insulation resistance, and correct phasing, which is great. I'd suggest adding a step to verify the final torque on all electrical connections and log the values.",
